{% comment %}
  Which product each add-on belongs with. An add-on can only sit in the cart, and is
  only suggested in the cart drawer, while at least one of its anchor products is in
  the cart. Removing the last anchor removes the add-on.

  Format: one rule per add-on, separated by ';'. Each rule is
  `addon-handle>anchor-handle,anchor-handle`.

  Every add-on here must also be listed in 'addon-products' (which hides its product
  page) and carry the product tag 'addon' (which keeps it out of The Bhandaar).

  Read by:
  - 'addon-allowed' (which add-ons the current cart permits)
  - layout/theme.liquid (window.TBKAddons, for assets/addon-guard.js)

  Usage:
  {%- capture addon_rules -%}{% render 'addon-anchors' %}{%- endcapture -%}
  {%- assign addon_rules = addon_rules | strip | split: ';' -%}
{% endcomment %}
gathri>paraat-bhujia;jhola>paraat-bhujia,handmade-bhujia
